  "description": "To escape his family, Damian joins a brutal war expecting to die. But his grim reality shifts when he reluctantly enters a pen pal program. Amidst the rain of bullets, Lintrey’s cheerful and witty letters become his only sanctuary. When tragedy forces him off the battlefield, he goes searching for her, only to find her home burned to ashes and a village claiming she never existed. Will he ever find the woman who gave him a reason to live, or was she nothing more than a beautiful illusion?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
